Parts of src/ (per-version handling of chat, windows and inventory, the tab
list, scoreboards and teams, position packets and physics integration, and the
digging, building, crafting, trading, book and enchanting features) are ported
from mineflayer (https://github.com/PrismarineJS/mineflayer), which is
distributed under the following license:

The MIT License (MIT)

