---------------------------------------------------------------------------

src/recipes.ts is a port of prismarine-recipe, src/features/raycast.ts follows
prismarine-world's RaycastIterator, and the pathfinder's goals and API follow
mineflayer-pathfinder; all three are PrismarineJS projects under the MIT license
(Copyright (c) PrismarineJS contributors), with the same terms as above.

The pathfinder's move costs, movement providers and partial-path selection
follow minecraft-pathfinding
(https://github.com/Minecraft-Pathfinding/minecraft-pathfinding,
Copyright (c) GenerelSchwerz), published under the MIT license with the same
terms as above. Its costs are Baritone's measured movement speeds.
